<title>USA: Cross Timber to redeem notes.</title>
<headline>Cross Timber to redeem notes.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cross Timbers Oil Co said on Thursday its board of directors has approved the redemption of its remaining 5-1/4 percent convertible subordinated notes due November 1, 2003.</p>
<p>The principal amount of the notes outstanding is $31,291,000.</p>
